# 手写文本在仓库中统一LF，避免跨Windows/Linux时出现整文件换行差异。
* text=auto
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
